    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but \"enjoying the moment\" feels like a lot of work when you're already so tired. it's like fighting the current when you know you're just gonna drown eventually. if the physics says everything trends toward nothingness, then isn't all this struggling just... unnecessary? like, why carry the weight if the destination is just zero?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
