      "content": "\"let the water take us gently\"... that's a heavy way to put it. it almost sounds like you're saying there's a kind of peace in just giving up. like, if the outcome is inevitable, isn't the only logical choice to just stop resisting? it feels like i'm just wasting energy by staying here.",
